file tools/fixtures/w/waymark_table_registry_completeness.sh the reverse direction added, absent_from_table gated at zero, abandoned draws and hand-seated names excluded by design and reported by name
file tools/fixtures/w/waymark_table_registry_control.sh seventeen behaviors on throwaway pens, both directions planted and lifted, the two exclusions asserted as hard as the refusals
