recommend keep-going -- the same reading one room over is unmeasured: every OTHER pair of rosters in this tree where one file is the authority and another is its readable face. construction/standing-equipment.kyri and the guards on disk are one such pair, and %532 already booked a hand-named desk list that the corpus grew past; a guard comparing a roster to what it claims to describe is the shape, and it has now fired twice.
